# Required for correct SEO output (canonical URLs, sitemap.xml, robots.txt,
# Open Graph tags and JSON-LD structured data all read this value).
# Set this in Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables to your
# actual live domain (no trailing slash). Replace the placeholder below —
# it is NOT your real domain.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://REPLACE-WITH-YOUR-DOMAIN.example
